==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[safe]] [[haven]]}}

# A place of [[safety]] or [[refuge]].
# A [[protect]]ed [[zone]] in a [[country]], especially one [[designate]]d for members of an [[ethnic]] or [[religious]] [[minority]].
# An [[investment]] that would lose little of its [[value]] in the event of a [[stock market]] [[crash]].
# A financially secure [[offshore]] [[bank]] or country during times of extreme uncertainty, or when domestic banks are suspected of becoming [[insolvency|insolvent]].
# The hours of the day when it is permissible for [[broadcast|broadcasting]] [[radio station]]s in the [[United States]] to broadcast [[profanity]] over [[radio wave]]s without fear of retribution from the [[FCC]].

